 "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><b style=\"font-size:31px;color:#0f766e\">Comida a domicilio</b><br><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#3f5f4d\">12 € a la semana = 624 € al año</span></div>": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><b style=\"font-size:31px;color:#0f766e\">Comida a domicilio</b><br><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#3f5f4d\">12 € á semana = 624 € ao ano</span></div>",
